+  // Gated on the clip being live. With the difference clip disabled (the flag
+  // off) the recorded vector changes nothing about the draw, and breaking a
+  // batch for it WOULD be observable — Skia's batched drawEdgeAAImageSet
+  // resolves antialiased seams between adjacent quads within one call, so
